    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7403" root="حذ" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَذَّ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَذُ3َ</span></b> , (L, Msb,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَذٌّ</span>, (L, Msb,
K,) <i>He cut,</i> or <i>cut off,</i> a thing: (Msb:) or <i>cut,</i>
or <i>cut off, quickly;</i> (IDrd, A, L;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَذَّ</span>:
(A:) or <i>cut off quickly and utterly:</i> (L:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَذٌّ</span> is
<i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَذٌّ</span>. (K.)

